==Battleground==
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns.
*4 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mr. Puffington]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**12 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Sunfish Jones]] spawns.
**2 [[Chickful A]]s spawn, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy way to beat this stage is to upgrade [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] to Lv.50+ with maxed Defense Buff and maxed [[Special Abilities#Resist|Resist Curse]] [[Talents]] to survive a hit from Mr. Puffington. Your [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] should also be Lv.50+ to survive hits from the [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]].

Bring [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]], [[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]] and optionally one more Research "Effect" UP [[Cat Combo]]. Also bring the aformentioned Ramen Cat and Slapstick Cats. The remaining slots can be filled with units of your choice. If you met the level requirements for the stage, you've effectively already won. Simply slap on a Rich Cat, start the battle, and spam Ramen Cat + Slapsticks until you are done with the stage.

If you have [[Detective Vigler (Uber Rare Cat)|Detective Vigler]], [[Lasvoss (Uber Rare Cat)|Lasvoss]], [[Kaoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Kaolan Pasalan]] and/or [[Trickster Himeyuri (Uber Rare Cat)|Trickster Himeyuri]], use them for their Research Combos ([[Cheating Heart? (Combo)|Cheating Heart?]], [[Bad Guys (Combo)|Bad Guys]], [[Sigh of Relief (Combo)|Sigh of Relief]] and [[Kimono Champs (Combo)|Kimono Champs]], respectively) so you can spam more Slapsticks.

[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] is also useful because of his low cost and high damage, though be careful using him once you've pushed into Chickful A's range.

[[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N2]] can deal extreme damage to Mr. Puffington if timed properly. On 2♛ and above, her True Form can be used for even more damage.

