==Trivia==
*In the French translation of [[The Battle Cats]], Hot Spring Reception and [[Revival of Origin]] share the same name: "Retour aux sources". ''Sources'' can mean either water springs/sources or causes/origins/roots of something, so depending on the context, the name translates to either "Back to the Roots" or "Back to the Water Sources".

